    "detailed_description": "Take on the challenge, let's have some fun!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay in the role of Mozz, a skilled Ghosting mercenary of the Neon Arlenis Heroic Guild, and take on the dangerous Ghosting Warrior Captains across action packed stages in a linear, Arcade-like style.<br />\r\nUnravel the mystery of the Half-Elf Swordsman who seems to be on your trail, are you really the hero of the story?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nMaster your gun, master your blade, balance your gameplay!<br />\r\n<br />\r\n***IMPORTANT: THIS GAME IS ON EARLY ACCESS***<br />\r\n<br />\r\nIncludes the story so far until mission 6, where you may get the &quot;bad&quot; ending.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSome features have not been implemented like control and key mapping or language settings.<br />\r\nGet an early start on the gameplay and characters, master your weapons!",
